        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Seth Rollins, Colby Daniel Lopez, Jirair S. Hovnanian, Dean Ambrose\n- Organizations: WWE\n- Places: New Jersey\n- Roles: professional wrestler, actor, home builder\n- Topics: Raw brand, Tag Team Champions\n\nFacts:\n- Jirair S. Hovnanian was born on June 9, 1927, and died on August 14, 2007.\n- Jirair S. Hovnanian was an Armenian Iraqi-American home builder based in New Jersey.\n- Colby Daniel Lopez was born on May 28, 1986.\n- Colby Daniel Lopez is an American professional wrestler and actor signed to WWE under the ring name Seth Rollins.\n- Seth Rollins performs on WWE's Raw brand.\n- Seth Rollins is one-half of the Raw brand's Tag Team Champions with Dean Ambrose in his second reign, which is his second as an individual and first with Dean Ambrose.",
